1. EXPORT AND IMPORT TO AND FROM MEXICO: LEARN FROM THE BASICS AND BOOST OR START YOUR IMPO-EXPO BUSINESS. 
Learn from the basics and enhance your business or start your own impo-expo business.  Learn how to use the NAFTA agreement and use the geographical situation with Mexico to take advantage and become an international company.  Also get to know the impo-expo process, customs regulations and the "tricks" to become an expert.  Get in touch with an expert of international trade and become familiar with a broker.  Also Spanish language support if necessary for anyone who needs assistance understanding terms or the whole course.  This course can be given "in-house" in your own location by request.
